### CampusQuest Mock Test Tests

### 1. Get All Mock Tests
GET http://localhost:5000/mock-tests

### 2. Get Mock Test Details
GET http://localhost:5000/mock-tests/1

### 3. Start Mock Test
POST http://localhost:5000/mock-tests/1/start
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Submit Mock Test
POST http://localhost:5000/mock-tests/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "answers": [
        {
            "question_id": 1,
            "selected_option": "B"
        }
    ]
}

### 5. Get Mock Test Result
GET http://localhost:5000/mock-tests/1/result
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE
